  "magiskGuide": "1. Unlock the bootloader first - Skello has an unlock wizard for that.\n2. Download Magisk only from the official repository.\n3. Copy your verified boot.img to the phone.\n4. In the Magisk app: Install → Select and Patch a File → pick boot.img.\n5. Copy the resulting magisk_patched-XXXXX.img back to the PC.\n6. Skello will flash it with fastboot flash boot.",
  "kernelsuGuide": "1. Make sure the kernel supports GKI 5.10 or newer, or find an LKM module built for your exact kernel.\n2. KernelSU patches boot.img in its official app on the phone; modules for a specific kernel come from the official KernelSU builds.\n3. After patching, Skello will flash the image with fastboot flash boot.",
  "apatchGuide": "1. Take kpatch exactly for the kernel version of your firmware.\n2. APatch patches boot.img in its official app on the phone.\n3. After patching, Skello will flash the image with fastboot flash boot.",
